Subject: [OE-core] [PATCH V3 2/2] u-boot: introduce UBOOT_INITIAL_ENV
Date: Wed,  3 Jun 2020 13:48:38 +0200
Message-Id: <20200603114838.13541-3-liu.ming50@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.26.2
